  ('h2',"16.4  The Dashboard for roles without full figures"),
  ('p',"If your role does not include the dashboard figures or the sales reports, the Dashboard no longer looks empty. It shows a short notice, today’s date and a card for each page your permissions allow, such as Invoice, Sales History, Customers, Products, Current Stock, Purchase Orders, Expenses and Sales Reports. Tap a card to open that page. If no card is shown, ask your store administrator to give your role the permissions you need (Chapter 9)."),
